  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables.png\" alt=\"小标志\" width=\"12.5%\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-right:1rem\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables_banner.png\" width=\"60%\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-right:1rem\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08/searchables/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/jaredlll08/searchables?style=flat-square\" alt=\"GitHub问题\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08/searchables/blob/1.19.4/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/jaredlll08/searchables?color=3da6e4&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"许可证\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Searchables是一个库模组，提供了辅助方法，支持根据组件（如</span>形状:方形 颜色:红色<span style=\"font-size:14px\">）搜索和过滤元素，同时内置自动补全功能。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>自动补全效果如下：</span></p><p><span><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables_autocomplete.gif\" alt=\"Searchables自动补全\" width=\"813\" height=\"406\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模组本身不产生任何效果，但可被其他模组用于改善搜索体验。</p><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fjared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/Nodecraft-logo-on-white.png\" alt=\"\"></a>  \n本项目由Nodecraft赞助。使用代码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fjared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JARED</a>可享受首月服务30%折扣！</strong></p>",
